            <p style="margin: 0in 0in 15.6pt; box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-ligatures: normal; text-align: start; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; "><span style="font-size: 13.5pt; color: #4e4a4a;">4. Cand si cum sunt folosite datele dvs. cu caracter personal</span></p>
